    "created_at": "2021-07-23T07:15:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-07-23T07:18:27Z",
    "body": "The goal is to inherit the policies from the creator. I believe you are right and there is a bug in the spec. I created #6895 to fix this.\r\n\r\nRegarding tests, you are right that we don't have specific tests for this. The problem in writing tests here is that no vendor (at least that I know of) implements this at the moment, although in chrome we would like to address this at some point. (Note that since blob URLs can only be navigated from the same-origin, I believe the security implications of this are very low.)\r\n\r\nI think we should merge the tests you created, though, even if they are failing on all vendors.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
